<Slide
  notes={`（0:45–1:20）发射端 9 V 经 7805 到 5 V，LM393 出 20 kHz 方波；31 MHz 晶体振荡加缓冲送末级，单管集电极调幅后上天线。接收端：天线先过 LC 预选，把 29、33 MHz 挡在检波前，再两级放大、BAT85 检波、OPA197 放大到 4 V 以上。调幅放末级、选频前置，是两个核心意图。`}
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '60px 60px 0 60px', background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}
>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#111111', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>
      总体方案：单管集电极调幅发射，LC 预选 + 包络检波接收
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#DCDCDC', marginTop: 12 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 24 }}>
      <Image src='assets/fig_chain.png' style={{ width: 1160, height: 330 }} />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 18, gap: 30 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 366, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F4E79' }}>① 调幅放在末级</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333333', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>载波先定频再调制，前后级不互相牵引</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 366, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F4E79' }}>② 选频前置</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333333', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>抑制压力交给检波前的 LC，不靠后级补救</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 366, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F4E79' }}>③ 各级留可调点</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333333', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>占空比、幅度、调谐、基带增益均可现场调</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 10 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8A8A' }}>31 MHz 模拟调幅无线方波传输系统　·　方案汇报</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8A8A' }}>03 / 07</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
